く","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"83","start":293.31,"end":295.32,"text":"失った筈の《左手の薬指》(場所)が","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"84","start":295.32,"end":297.39,"text":"虚しく疼いた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"85","start":297.39,"end":300.31,"text":"ふと彼が監視鏡(Monitor)の向こうへ視線を戻すと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"86","start":300.31,"end":301.36,"text":"嗚呼...","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"87","start":301.36,"end":303.35,"text":"いつの間にか少女の背後には","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"88","start":303.35,"end":306.35,"text":"『仮面の男』が立っていた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}